flowchart LR
    R[Normalized search result] --> N{Complete person name?}
    N -->|No| X[Reject with typed category]
    N -->|Yes| I{Plausible institution label?}
    I -->|No| X
    I -->|Yes| P[Prospective Supervisor]
    P --> E[Extract known page]
    E --> S[Typed structured evidence drafts]
    S --> V[Validate and ground each draft]
    V -->|Valid| C[Persist provenance-bound EvidenceClaim]
    V -->|Invalid| D[Discard only that draft]
    C --> Q{Evidence sufficient?}
    D --> Q
    Q -->|No; retry remains| A[Search once for alternate official person profile]
    A --> E
    Q -->|Yes| F[Research Fit evaluation]
    Q -->|No; retry exhausted| Z[Stop with partial verification]
